    "---\n",
    "## 9. 🧪 `*args`, `**kwargs` & Unpacking <a id='9'></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### What & Why\n",
    "Python's flexible argument system lets you write highly reusable, composable functions — essential in data engineering where you build generic pipeline components that must work across many different data sources and configs.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Syntax | Meaning |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `*args` | Collects extra positional arguments into a tuple |\n",
    "| `**kwargs` | Collects extra keyword arguments into a dict |\n",
    "| `*iterable` in a call | Unpacks iterable as positional args |\n",
    "| `**dict` in a call | Unpacks dict as keyword args |\n",
    "| `a, *rest = [1,2,3,4]` | Star unpacking in assignment |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why this matters for Data Engineers\n",
    "- **Generic pipeline runners** — accept any combination of source/destination options\n",
    "- **Config merging** — combine default and override dicts with `{**defaults, **overrides}`\n",
    "- **Dynamic function calls** — call functions whose argument lists are determined at runtime\n",
    "- **Middleware/wrapper patterns** — pass through arguments to wrapped functions"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "concept9-code1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── *args: Accept any number of positional arguments ─────────────────────────\n",
    "def merge_datasets(*datasets):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Merge any number of record lists into one.\"\"\"\n",
    "    merged = []\n",
    "    for ds in datasets:\n",
    "        merged.extend(ds)\n",
    "    print(f\"Merged {len(datasets)} datasets → {len(merged)} total records\")\n",
    "    return merged\n",
    "\n",
    "orders  = [{'id': 1}, {'id': 2}]\n",
    "returns = [{'id': 3}]\n",
    "manual  = [{'id': 4}, {'id': 5}, {'id': 6}]\n",
    "\n",
    "all_data = merge_datasets(orders, returns, manual)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Unpack a list of datasets dynamically\n",
    "source_list = [orders, returns, manual]\n",
    "all_data2 = merge_datasets(*source_list)   # Same as above"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
